                    insight_forcedstop:     `Force-liquidated: drawdown reached the 15% board hard stop and the book was liquidated at the worst possible price. The risk budget is non-negotiable — no ESG score survives a forced de-risking into a falling market.`,
                    insight_mixed:          `A mixed outcome: parts of the rebalance landed, but the threshold, CSR weight, execution and overlay did not fully reinforce each other — enough seams for the covenant or the risk budget to stay under question at the audit.`,
                    insight_redemption:     `The covenant breached for a second consecutive audit: ฿12bn of European-LP AUM is now armed to redeem at no penalty, which would collapse the fund below viable scale. A single downgrade should never have been allowed to do this — that is what the buffer and CSR cap were for.`,
